# The Rootcore's acid seep with a suit on (CIPlay the_rootcore_acidsuit, 11-08; run `CIGapsSuit 300` first - the island
# has no suit of its own, the seep is optional): the acid takes nothing (the_rootcore_acid is the run without it).
island The Rootcore keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at -25.4 4.05 h=2.3
wait 9
expect unhurt
walk -25.4 4.05 to -23 4.6 to -21 5.5 below=20
expect unhurt
